WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.686 --> 00:00:04.586
<i>♪ DOO-BEE-DOO-WAH ♪</i>

2
00:00:04.655 --> 00:00:06.104
<i>♪ DOO-WAH ♪</i>

3
00:00:08.743 --> 00:00:10.809
<i>♪ WHEN LIFE
IS GETTING TO YOU ♪</i>

4
00:00:10.877 --> 00:00:12.555
<i>♪ PUT SOME FRESH
IN YOUR LIFE ♪</i>

5
00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:15.047
<i>♪ LET MINTOS
FRESHEN UP YOUR LIFE ♪</i>

6
00:00:15.899 --> 00:00:17.449
<i>♪ LIFE IS JUST A BREEZE ♪</i>

7
00:00:17.518 --> 00:00:19.128
<i>♪ WHEN YOU STAY
FRESH AND COOL ♪</i>

8
00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:22.037
<i>♪ BECAUSE MINTOS
PUTS THE FRESH IN LIFE ♪</i>

9
00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:25.340
<i>♪ TASTE THAT FRESHNESS.
JUST CAN'T BEAT IT ♪</i>

10
00:00:25.408 --> 00:00:26.741
<i>♪ MINTOS FRESHNESS ♪</i>

11
00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:28.943
<i>♪ LET MINTOS
FRESHEN YOUR LIFE ♪</i>

12
00:00:30.497 --> 00:00:32.798
[Announcer]
<i>MINTOS. THE FRESHMAKER.</i>

13
00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:34.527
THESE COMMERCIALS
ARE STUPID.

14
00:00:34.551 --> 00:00:36.913
THEY CERTAINLY DON'T
MAKE ME WANT A MINTO.

15
00:00:36.937 --> 00:00:38.047
TOTALLY INEFFECTIVE.

16
00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.921
MUST KILL
LINCOLN.

17
00:00:41.408 --> 00:00:44.626
♪ IT SEEMS TODAY
THAT ALL YOU SEE ♪

18
00:00:44.695 --> 00:00:48.179
♪ IS VIOLENCE IN MOVIES
AND SEX ON T.V. ♪

19
00:00:48.248 --> 00:00:51.683
♪ BUT WHERE ARE THOSE GOOD.
OLD-FASHIONED VALUES ♪

20
00:00:51.752 --> 00:00:53.902
♪ ON WHICH WE USED TO RELY? ♪

21
00:00:54.822 --> 00:00:58.039
♪ LUCKY THERE'S A FAMILY GUY ♪

22
00:00:58.108 --> 00:01:01.309
♪ LUCKY THERE'S A MAN
WHO'LL POSITIVELY TELL YOU ♪

23
00:01:01.378 --> 00:01:03.089
♪ ALL THE THINGS
THAT MAKE US ♪

24
00:01:03.113 --> 00:01:04.512
♪ LAUGH 'N' CRY ♪

25
00:01:04.598 --> 00:01:09.985
♪ HE'S A FAMILY GUY ♪

26
00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:12.687
♪ [Playing piano]

27
00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:17.959
[Crowd applauding]

28
00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:24.232
AAH!

29
00:01:24.301 --> 00:01:25.344
[Stewie]
BLAST YOU. WOMAN!

30
00:01:25.368 --> 00:01:26.768
AWAKE FROM YOUR
DAMNABLE REVERIE!

31
00:01:26.854 --> 00:01:27.703
[Sighs]

32
00:01:27.771 --> 00:01:29.816
HONEY. I'M DOING
THE DISHES.

33
00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:32.090
A THOUSAND PARDONS
FOR DISRUPTING

34
00:01:32.159 --> 00:01:33.820
YOUR FLATWARE
SANITATION RITUAL.

35
00:01:33.844 --> 00:01:35.605
BUT YOU SEE. I'M
IN SEARING PAIN!

36
00:01:35.629 --> 00:01:37.557
YOU'RE JUST
TEETHING. STEWIE.

37
00:01:37.581 --> 00:01:39.725
IT'S A NORMAL PART
OF A BABY'S LIFE.

38
00:01:39.749 --> 00:01:42.245
VERY WELL THEN.
I ORDER YOU TO
KILL ME AT ONCE!

39
00:01:42.269 --> 00:01:44.097
HONEY. I KNOW
YOU'RE HURTING.

40
00:01:44.121 --> 00:01:46.850
BUT MOMMY HAS TO
CLEAN UP THE HOUSE.
ALL RIGHT?

41
00:01:46.874 --> 00:01:47.968
NO. IT'S NOT ALL RIGHT!

42
00:01:47.992 --> 00:01:49.524
FOR THE LOVE
OF GOD. SHAKE ME!

43
00:01:49.593 --> 00:01:51.176
SHAKE ME LIKE
A BRITISH NANNY!

44
00:01:51.228 --> 00:01:52.244
[Sighing]

45
00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:55.330
OH. MAN.
THIS IS THE LIFE.

46
00:01:55.399 --> 00:01:59.084
HAND ME ANOTHER ONE OF
THEM PAWTUCKET PATRIOTS.

47
00:01:59.153 --> 00:02:02.170
GUYS. I WANT TO SAY
A TOAST TO YOU.

48
00:02:02.238 --> 00:02:04.189
QUAGMIRE. CLEVELAND...

49
00:02:05.626 --> 00:02:06.626
BRIAN.

50
00:02:06.677 --> 00:02:09.143
YEAH. IF YOU GUYS
WERE BEERS.

51
00:02:09.212 --> 00:02:11.563
I WOULD DRINK
EVERY ONE OF YOU.

52
00:02:11.632 --> 00:02:14.415
AND I WISH YOU WERE
BECAUSE WE'RE OUT.

53
00:02:14.484 --> 00:02:16.067
[Laughing]

54
00:02:16.136 --> 00:02:18.503
THAT'S FUNNY.
THAT'S EVEN MORE HUMOROUS

55
00:02:18.572 --> 00:02:20.855
THAN THAT JOKE YOU
TOLD US LAST NIGHT.

56
00:02:20.924 --> 00:02:22.819
OK. SO A JEWISH GUY
AND A CHINESE GUY

57
00:02:22.843 --> 00:02:24.659
WALK INTO
A BAR. RIGHT?

58
00:02:24.728 --> 00:02:26.244
WAIT A SECOND.

59
00:02:29.199 --> 00:02:31.716
JEWISH GUY AND A CHINESE GUY
WALK INTO A BAR.

60
00:02:31.785 --> 00:02:34.246
AND THERE'S A NAKED
PRIEST SITTING THERE.
AND HE...

61
00:02:34.270 --> 00:02:35.503
OH. SORRY. FATHER.

62
00:02:35.572 --> 00:02:36.938
NO. I'VE HEARD THEM ALL.

63
00:02:37.024 --> 00:02:39.024
OH. LOOK AT THE TIME.

64
00:02:39.093 --> 00:02:41.554
I PROMISED LORETTA
I WAS GONNA
TRIM THE HEDGES

65
00:02:41.578 --> 00:02:43.122
AND BE TENDER
WITH HER.

66
00:02:43.146 --> 00:02:44.263
BELIEVE ME.
CLEVELAND.

67
00:02:44.331 --> 00:02:46.431
OUR WIVES NEED SOME TIME
OFF AS MUCH AS WE DO.

68
00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:48.245
THIS IS WHEN
LOIS DOES ALL THOSE

69
00:02:48.269 --> 00:02:50.318
LITTLE THINGS THAT
WOMEN LIKE TO DO.

70
00:02:51.238 --> 00:02:53.021
[Grunting]

71
00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:54.756
[Car horn honking]

72
00:03:00.915 --> 00:03:03.114
I'LL BE ON YOUR
BED. NO CALLS.

73
00:03:03.183 --> 00:03:04.549
HEY. LOIS.

74
00:03:04.618 --> 00:03:07.085
I KNOW. YOU'VE BEEN
BUSY ALL DAY. SO I
TOOK CARE OF DINNER.

75
00:03:07.137 --> 00:03:08.587
REALLY?

76
00:03:08.656 --> 00:03:11.136
ALL YOU GOTTA DO
IS GUT IT. CLEAN IT.
SCALE IT. AND COOK IT.

77
00:03:11.174 --> 00:03:12.440
MM-UAH.

78
00:03:12.509 --> 00:03:14.704
PETER. I SPENT ALL
MORNING CLEANING
UP THE HOUSE.

79
00:03:14.728 --> 00:03:17.724
AND IN 5 SECONDS.
YOU TURN IT INTO
LOW TIDE AT THE PIER.

80
00:03:17.748 --> 00:03:20.365
JEEZ. I'M SORRY. HONEY.
I'D HELP YOU CLEAN IT UP.

81
00:03:20.433 --> 00:03:22.901
BUT YOU KNOW HOW LOUSY
I AM WITH HOUSEWORK.

82
00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:24.714
REMEMBER WHEN I
TRIED DOING THE LAUNDRY?

83
00:03:24.738 --> 00:03:26.621
LET'S SEE.
SHIRTS. PANTS...

84
00:03:26.689 --> 00:03:28.656
H-HEY. I'M MISSING
ANOTHER SOCK.

85
00:03:28.725 --> 00:03:29.725
HEY!

86
00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:33.489
WELCOME TO NARNIA.
I'M MR. TUMNUS.

87
00:03:33.513 --> 00:03:36.197
GIVE ME BACK MY SOCK.
YOU GOAT BASTARD!

88
00:03:36.699 --> 00:03:38.200
HEY!

89
00:03:38.285 --> 00:03:40.396
YOU'RE RIGHT. IT'S
BETTER IF I DO IT.

90
00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:43.433
[Stewie]
AH! DAMN IT TO THE BOWELS
OF BLOODY HELL!

91
00:03:43.457 --> 00:03:45.857
THE BABY'S UP.
CAN YOU GET HIM?

92
00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:47.820
OK. I HOPE HE
DOESN'T NEED CHANGING.

93
00:03:47.844 --> 00:03:50.764
I'M A LITTLE GUN-SHY
AFTER WHAT
HAPPENED LAST TIME.

94
00:03:51.765 --> 00:03:53.164
NO. YOU IMBECILE!

95
00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:55.384
THAT'S NOT TALC!
THAT'S PAPRIKA! AAH!

96
00:03:55.969 --> 00:03:57.185
TAKE THAT!

97
00:03:57.254 --> 00:03:59.482
ALL RIGHT.
I'LL DO THAT. TOO!

98
00:03:59.506 --> 00:04:01.826
CAN YOU AT LEAST TAKE
CHRIS TO HIS GAME?

99
00:04:01.875 --> 00:04:04.458
JEEZ. LOIS. I SPENT
ALL MORNING ON A
BOAT WITH MY FRIENDS

100
00:04:04.527 --> 00:04:06.728
DRINKING BEER.
TELLING JOKES.
AND SCREWING AROUND.

101
00:04:06.797 --> 00:04:08.263
HOW ABOUT A LITTLE
ME TIME?

102
00:04:08.332 --> 00:04:10.760
HONEY. I'M BEGGING YOU.
DROP CHRIS OFF
AT HIS SOCCER GAME

103
00:04:10.784 --> 00:04:11.944
AND COME
RIGHT HOME.

104
00:04:11.968 --> 00:04:13.446
I NEED YOU TO
LOOK AFTER STEWIE

105
00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:15.498
WHILE I'M TEACHING
PIANO LESSONS. PLEASE!

106
00:04:15.522 --> 00:04:17.406
ALL RIGHT! ALL RIGHT!

107
00:04:17.491 --> 00:04:19.157
HEH. YOU KNOW I SPOIL YOU.

108
00:04:21.495 --> 00:04:22.911
THANKS FOR
THE RIDE. DAD.

109
00:04:22.979 --> 00:04:25.091
ALL RIGHT.
HAVE FUN. CHRIS.

110
00:04:25.115 --> 00:04:26.115
HEY. PETEY!

111
00:04:26.149 --> 00:04:27.610
QUAGMIRE? WHAT
ARE YOU DOING HERE?

112
00:04:27.634 --> 00:04:29.594
OH. YOU KNOW.
SOCCER MOMS!

113
00:04:29.619 --> 00:04:30.835
[Giggling]

114
00:04:31.688 --> 00:04:33.121
ALL RIGHT.

115
00:04:33.189 --> 00:04:35.801
I'D LIKE TO HANG
AROUND WITH YOU.
BUT LOIS NEEDS ME AT HOME.

116
00:04:35.825 --> 00:04:37.809
I GOT BEER.

117
00:04:37.877 --> 00:04:40.228
BOO. LOIS! YAY. BEER!

118
00:04:42.316 --> 00:04:43.448
SHH. SHH. SHH.

119
00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:45.116
IT'S OK. STEWIE.

120
00:04:45.184 --> 00:04:47.085
WHERE THE
HELL'S PETER?

121
00:04:47.154 --> 00:04:51.823
THAT WAS GOOD. REUBEN.
NOW PLAY BRAHMS' <i>LULLABY.</i>

122
00:04:51.892 --> 00:04:55.160
♪ LULLABY AND GOOD NIGHT ♪

123
00:04:55.228 --> 00:04:58.113
ENOUGH! THE ONLY THING WORSE
THAN THE WRETCHED PAIN

124
00:04:58.182 --> 00:05:00.502
IN MY MOUTH IS THE EXCREMENT
SPEWING FROM YOURS!

125
00:05:00.567 --> 00:05:03.101
OH. I WISH I COULD MAKE
THE PAIN GO AWAY SOONER.

126
00:05:03.169 --> 00:05:05.404
BUT I CAN'T
TURN TIME FORWARD.

127
00:05:05.472 --> 00:05:06.504
OH. NO!

128
00:05:06.573 --> 00:05:07.789
PERHAPS I CAN!

129
00:05:07.874 --> 00:05:10.125
OF COURSE! I'LL SIMPLY
BUILD A MACHINE

130
00:05:10.193 --> 00:05:11.709
THAT CAN MOVE TIME!

131
00:05:11.778 --> 00:05:12.978
I SHALL CALL IT...

132
00:05:13.046 --> 00:05:14.312
A TIME MACHINE.

133
00:05:14.381 --> 00:05:15.547
♪ [Discordant note]

134
00:05:15.615 --> 00:05:17.365
E-FLAT. SALIERI! E-FLAT!

135
00:05:17.434 --> 00:05:19.017
[People cheering]

136
00:05:19.769 --> 00:05:21.247
[Peter]
GO. CHRIS!

137
00:05:21.271 --> 00:05:24.939
DADDY LOVES YOU!
I MEAN IN A PLATONIC
WAY. I'M MARRIED.

138
00:05:27.126 --> 00:05:28.160
[Whistle blowing]

139
00:05:28.228 --> 00:05:31.195
HAND BALL!
PENALTY KICK. BLUE!

140
00:05:31.264 --> 00:05:33.165
THAT'S THE 10TH
TIME TODAY!

141
00:05:33.233 --> 00:05:34.566
NICE GRAB.
ORCA.

142
00:05:34.634 --> 00:05:36.417
GET MOBY DICK
OFF THE FIELD

143
00:05:36.486 --> 00:05:38.653
BEFORE HE BURPS
UP A LICENSE PLATE!

144
00:05:38.721 --> 00:05:40.633
EASY. FELLA.
THAT'S MY KID.

145
00:05:40.657 --> 00:05:41.840
NOW APOLOGIZE.

146
00:05:41.908 --> 00:05:43.724
OK. I'M SORRY YOUR
KID'S A BRAIN DEAD

147
00:05:43.793 --> 00:05:45.527
STINKING BLUE
CHEESE FETA!

148
00:05:45.612 --> 00:05:47.128
THAT'S IT!

149
00:05:47.848 --> 00:05:49.714
WAY TO GO. DAD!

150
00:05:49.783 --> 00:05:51.315
YOU HIT MY MOM!

151
00:05:51.384 --> 00:05:52.634
NO. I HIT YOUR DAD.

152
00:05:52.702 --> 00:05:54.285
STAND BACK.
GIVE HER SOME AIR.

153
00:05:54.354 --> 00:05:55.932
YOU MEAN. "GIVE
HIM SOME AIR."

154
00:05:55.956 --> 00:05:58.218
CALL AN AMBULANCE.
SHE'S GOING INTO LABOR.

155
00:05:58.242 --> 00:06:00.170
YOU MEAN. "HE'S
GOING INTO LABOR."

156
00:06:00.194 --> 00:06:01.926
[Baby crying]

157
00:06:01.995 --> 00:06:03.195
WHOOPS.

158
00:06:08.268 --> 00:06:10.163
I CAN'T BELIEVE I
PUNCHED A WOMAN.

159
00:06:10.187 --> 00:06:11.286
A PREGNANT
WOMAN.

160
00:06:11.354 --> 00:06:13.133
I JUST HOPE SHE ACCEPTS
MY PEACE OFFERING.

161
00:06:13.157 --> 00:06:15.157
I SENT HER A LITTLE
SOMETHING FOR THE BABY.

162
00:06:17.477 --> 00:06:18.744
♪ [Music playing]

163
00:06:19.913 --> 00:06:21.457
I WOULD'VE BROUGHT
IT OVER MYSELF

164
00:06:21.481 --> 00:06:22.975
IF I WASN'T
UNDER HOUSE ARREST.

165
00:06:22.999 --> 00:06:26.067
YOU'RE JUST FORTUNATE
THIS IS YOUR
FIRST OFFENSE. PETER.

166
00:06:26.136 --> 00:06:28.181
NO KIDDIN'.
COULD'VE BEEN A LOT
WORSE IF THE COPS

167
00:06:28.205 --> 00:06:30.325
KNEW ABOUT THE OTHER TIMES
I BROKE THE LAW.

168
00:06:32.626 --> 00:06:34.687
AND THERE WAS THAT TIME
I TOOK A WHIZ IN PUBLIC.

169
00:06:34.711 --> 00:06:37.178
[Kids laughing]

170
00:06:37.247 --> 00:06:38.975
AND THAT TIME I
SNUCK INTO WIMBLEDON.

171
00:06:38.999 --> 00:06:41.416
[Tennis balls clacking]

172
00:06:41.484 --> 00:06:43.951
HA. ME AND CLEVELAND
ARE GONNA "AMSCRAY."

173
00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:46.099
WAIT. W-WAIT.
YOU GUYS CAN'T LEAVE
ME HERE ALONE.

174
00:06:46.123 --> 00:06:47.600
WHY DON'T YOU
COME WITH US?

175
00:06:47.624 --> 00:06:49.051
I CAN'T LEAVE
THE PREMISES.

176
00:06:49.075 --> 00:06:50.703
THEY'RE MONITORING
MY EVERY MOVE.

177
00:06:50.727 --> 00:06:51.993
[Beeping]

178
00:06:53.881 --> 00:06:55.291
[Peter]
I GOTTA GET OUT OF HERE!

179
00:06:55.315 --> 00:06:56.342
I GOTTA GET OUT OF HERE!

180
00:06:56.366 --> 00:06:58.461
THERE'S MY LITTLE
HOUSE HUSBAND.

181
00:06:58.485 --> 00:07:00.885
IT'S BEEN SO WONDERFUL
HAVING YOU HOME ALL WEEK.

182
00:07:00.921 --> 00:07:02.770
THANKS. HONEY.
BUT HONESTLY I DUNNO

183
00:07:02.839 --> 00:07:04.383
HOW YOU STAND BEIN'
IN THE HOUSE ALL DAY.

184
00:07:04.407 --> 00:07:07.325
I MEAN. I'M SO BORED.
I CAN'T EVEN
WATCH T.V. ANYMORE.

185
00:07:07.393 --> 00:07:09.644
ALL THE SHOWS ARE
STARTING TO RUN TOGETHER.

186
00:07:09.713 --> 00:07:11.540
[Man]
<i>THIS SHOW CONTAINS</i>
<i>ADULT CONTENT</i>

187
00:07:11.564 --> 00:07:13.359
<i>AND IS BROUGHT TO YOU
BY THE LETTER "H".</i>

188
00:07:13.383 --> 00:07:14.532
[Siren wailing]

189
00:07:14.601 --> 00:07:15.466
[Telephone ringing]

190
00:07:15.535 --> 00:07:17.168
AH. HELLO?

191
00:07:17.905 --> 00:07:19.153
[Sighs]

192
00:07:19.223 --> 00:07:21.356
SON OF A BITCH.
I'M ON MY WAY.

193
00:07:21.425 --> 00:07:23.224
SOME POOR BASTARD
GOT HIS HEAD BLOWN OFF

194
00:07:23.293 --> 00:07:25.176
DOWN AT A PLACE
CALLED HOOPER'S.

195
00:07:26.613 --> 00:07:28.941
BERT. I WISH
YOU WOULDN'T
DRINK SO MUCH. BERT.

196
00:07:28.965 --> 00:07:32.417
WELL. ERNIE. I
WISH YOU WOULDN'T EAT
COOKIES IN THE DAMN BED!

197
00:07:32.485 --> 00:07:34.766
BERT. YOU'RE
SHOUTING AGAIN. BERT!

198
00:07:35.438 --> 00:07:36.721
[Sighs]

199
00:07:38.408 --> 00:07:40.859
I KNOW YOU CAN'T
UNDERSTAND WHAT
I'M GOING THROUGH.

200
00:07:40.927 --> 00:07:42.560
ALL THE STUFF
THAT MAKES YOU HAPPY

201
00:07:42.629 --> 00:07:44.029
LIKE COOKING
AND CLEANING.

202
00:07:44.097 --> 00:07:46.230
IS RIGHT IN THE HOUSE
JUST WAITING FOR YOU.

203
00:07:46.299 --> 00:07:48.650
YOU ARE ONE LUCKY...
AH-AH. STOP NOW.

204
00:07:48.719 --> 00:07:51.380
PETER. I DON'T
DO THOSE THINGS
BECAUSE I ENJOY THEM.

205
00:07:51.404 --> 00:07:53.888
I DO THEM BECAUSE
I LOVE MY FAMILY.

206
00:07:53.957 --> 00:07:54.973
[Laughing]

207
00:07:55.042 --> 00:07:58.126
LOIS LOVES HER FAMILY.
LOIS LOVES HER FAMILY.

208
00:07:58.194 --> 00:08:02.080
♪ LOIS AND THE FAMILY
SITTING IN A TREE ♪

209
00:08:02.148 --> 00:08:04.599
SEE. LOIS. THE GUYS
WOULD'VE FOUND
THAT HILARIOUS.

210
00:08:04.667 --> 00:08:06.578
WHY DON'T I GO
BUY SOME GROCERIES

211
00:08:06.602 --> 00:08:08.497
AND MAKE US A NICE
ROMANTIC DINNER?

212
00:08:08.521 --> 00:08:10.349
LIKE WHEN WE
WERE DATING.

213
00:08:10.373 --> 00:08:12.651
THAT OUGHTA TAKE
YOUR MIND OFF THE GUYS.

214
00:08:12.675 --> 00:08:14.759
IT ALREADY HAS.

215
00:08:14.828 --> 00:08:17.148
I WONDER WHAT
THE GUYS ARE UP TO?

216
00:08:19.649 --> 00:08:21.315
OH. THAT'S NASTY.

217
00:08:25.088 --> 00:08:27.328
WHERE'S THE DAMN
PULL STRING?

218
00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:28.322
AH.

219
00:08:28.391 --> 00:08:29.890
AAH!

220
00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:32.655
HA. YOU NEVER KNOW
WHAT YOU'RE GONNA
FIND DOWN HERE.

221
00:08:32.679 --> 00:08:33.411
[Barking]

222
00:08:33.479 --> 00:08:34.479
AAH!

223
00:08:36.449 --> 00:08:38.529
[Man]
PETER!

224
00:08:38.585 --> 00:08:40.651
HEY. YOU'RE THE
PAWTUCKET PATRIOT.

225
00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:43.388
VERILY. COME HITHER
AND GIVE HEED.

226
00:08:43.457 --> 00:08:45.606
WHOA. I DON'T
SWING THAT WAY. PAL.

227
00:08:45.675 --> 00:08:47.670
LOOK. I GOT A DATE
WITH MY FEMALE WIFE.

228
00:08:47.694 --> 00:08:49.388
I JUST CAME DOWN
TO GET SOME BEERS.

229
00:08:49.412 --> 00:08:51.407
WHY SPEND TIME
WITH YOUR WIFE?

230
00:08:51.431 --> 00:08:53.760
IF YOU BUILD A BAR
IN THIS BASEMENT

231
00:08:53.784 --> 00:08:57.168
AND STOCK IT WITH PLENTY
OF FROSTY PAWTUCKET PATRIOTS

232
00:08:57.237 --> 00:09:00.538
YOUR FRIENDS
WILL COME DOWN HERE
FOR A BEER AS WELL.

233
00:09:00.607 --> 00:09:03.024
BUILD A BAR!
THAT'S A GREAT IDEA.

234
00:09:04.494 --> 00:09:06.577
WAIT. ONE LAST QUESTION.

235
00:09:06.646 --> 00:09:09.997
IF I WALK THROUGH YOU.
DOES THAT MEAN.
LIKE. WE'VE DONE IT?

236
00:09:11.251 --> 00:09:13.651
JEEZ. WHAT'S WITH
YOU AND THE GAY JOKES?

237
00:09:47.621 --> 00:09:50.071
[Sighing]

238
00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:52.985
PETER. WHERE THE
HELL HAVE YOU BEEN?
WE HAD A DATE.

239
00:09:53.009 --> 00:09:55.437
SORRY. HONEY.
I MUST'VE LOST
TRACK OF THE TIME.

240
00:09:55.461 --> 00:09:57.557
WHAT DO YOU SAY?
YOU THINK THE
GUYS WILL LIKE IT?

241
00:09:57.581 --> 00:09:59.475
THIS IS WHY YOU
MISSED OUR DINNER?

242
00:09:59.499 --> 00:10:01.344
TO MAKE A BAR
FOR YOUR FRIENDS?

243
00:10:01.368 --> 00:10:02.448
YEAH. ISN'T IT GREAT?

244
00:10:02.485 --> 00:10:04.380
OH. BOY. I FEEL JUST
LIKE TIM ALLEN.

245
00:10:04.404 --> 00:10:06.588
I BUILD STUFF AND I
HAVE A CRIMINAL RECORD.

246
00:10:06.656 --> 00:10:08.373
[Grunting]

247
00:10:08.441 --> 00:10:10.408
[Men laughing]

248
00:10:10.476 --> 00:10:12.760
OK. GUYS. I GOT
ANOTHER ONE.

249
00:10:12.829 --> 00:10:16.047
WHAT'S THE DIFFERENCE
BETWEEN PORNOGRAPHY AND ART?

250
00:10:16.116 --> 00:10:17.593
[Snickering]
HERE IT COMES.

251
00:10:17.617 --> 00:10:19.350
A GOVERNMENT GRANT.

252
00:10:19.418 --> 00:10:20.801
[All laughing]

253
00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:22.970
PETER. YOU ARE IN THE ZONE.

254
00:10:24.507 --> 00:10:26.619
HEY. HONEY. YOU
KNOW THOSE
LITTLE CLAM CAKES

255
00:10:26.643 --> 00:10:28.321
YOU MAKE WHENEVER
WE HAVE COMPANY?

256
00:10:28.345 --> 00:10:29.855
I NEED ABOUT
A DOZEN.

257
00:10:29.879 --> 00:10:31.890
ACTUALLY. BETTER
MAKE IT LIKE 600.

258
00:10:31.914 --> 00:10:33.931
THAT'S IT. PETER!
I'M NOT A SERVANT.

259
00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.735
AND I'M THROUGH
TAKING CARE OF YOU
AND YOUR BAR BUDDIES!

260
00:10:36.803 --> 00:10:40.254
JEEZ. WHERE THE HELL
DID THAT COME FROM?

261
00:10:40.323 --> 00:10:43.007
WATCH THE KIDS.
I'M TAKING A HOT BATH.

262
00:10:43.076 --> 00:10:45.860
PUT ME DOWN.
YOU BLUNDERBUSS!

263
00:10:45.928 --> 00:10:47.896
HE'S A LITTLE
CRANKY FROM TEETHING.

264
00:10:47.964 --> 00:10:49.297
AH. I CAN FIX THAT.

265
00:10:49.365 --> 00:10:50.248
[Mumbling]

266
00:10:50.317 --> 00:10:51.633
GOOD GOD. MAN!

267
00:10:51.701 --> 00:10:53.646
ONE CAN ONLY
IMAGINE WHAT FOUL REGIONS

268
00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:55.598
THAT FINGER HAS
ERSTWHILE PROBED!

269
00:10:55.622 --> 00:10:57.021
THERE YOU GO.

270
00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:59.868
MY MOTHER USED TO
USE WHISKEY WHENEVER
I HAD A TOOTHACHE.

271
00:10:59.892 --> 00:11:01.426
MY TOOTH HURTS!

272
00:11:02.462 --> 00:11:04.356
[Peter]
THERE. HOW'S THAT FEEL?

273
00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:05.996
WELL. IT-IT'S...

274
00:11:06.065 --> 00:11:07.248
IT'S DELIGHTFUL.

275
00:11:07.317 --> 00:11:08.583
MMM.

276
00:11:08.652 --> 00:11:09.968
[Water trickling]

277
00:11:10.036 --> 00:11:12.152
[Crowd cheering]

278
00:11:12.221 --> 00:11:14.789
THANK YOU.
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

279
00:11:16.125 --> 00:11:18.025
LOIS. YOU ARE A
WONDERFUL WOMAN.

280
00:11:18.094 --> 00:11:19.460
WORDS CANNOT
EXPRESS

281
00:11:19.546 --> 00:11:22.163
THE DEPTH OF MY
APPRECIATION AND
LOVE FOR YOU.

282
00:11:22.232 --> 00:11:23.998
OH. PETER!

283
00:11:29.289 --> 00:11:30.487
AAH!

284
00:11:30.556 --> 00:11:31.572
HEY. YOU MUST BE LOIS.

285
00:11:35.228 --> 00:11:36.822
NO. NO.
NOT SILICONE.

286
00:11:36.846 --> 00:11:38.991
SILICON. AND THE
DESIGN OF THE DEVICE

287
00:11:39.015 --> 00:11:40.215
IS QUITE INGENIOUS

288
00:11:40.282 --> 00:11:43.150
IF I DO SAY SO
MYSELF. MISTY.

289
00:11:43.219 --> 00:11:45.186
WHAT A DELIGHTFUL MONIKER.

290
00:11:46.172 --> 00:11:47.871
YOU SEE. MISTY.

291
00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:49.100
[Snickering]

292
00:11:49.158 --> 00:11:51.609
MY TIME MANIPULATOR
EMPLOYS AXIOMS

293
00:11:51.678 --> 00:11:54.946
FROM THE QUANTUM THEORY
OF MOLECULAR PROPULSION.

294
00:11:55.014 --> 00:11:57.148
I'VE BROKEN MY PENCIL!

295
00:11:57.217 --> 00:11:59.484
I HAVE A <i>BARNEY</i>
PEN IN MY PURSE.

296
00:12:00.987 --> 00:12:03.270
YOU ARE SPECTACULAR!

297
00:12:06.159 --> 00:12:07.786
CHRIS. WHAT ARE
YOU DOING HERE?

298
00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:10.728
SORRY. MOM.
I'M GONNA NEED
TO SEE SOME I.D.

299
00:12:10.797 --> 00:12:12.837
CHRIS. GO TO
YOUR ROOM!

300
00:12:13.816 --> 00:12:14.861
HELLO. MOTHER.

301
00:12:14.885 --> 00:12:16.312
CARE TO PARTAKE
IN ONE OF YOUR

302
00:12:16.336 --> 00:12:19.604
OH-SO-EXHILARATING
GAMES OF PEEKABOO?

303
00:12:19.672 --> 00:12:22.189
OH. MY GOD!
MY BABY IS DRUNK!

304
00:12:22.258 --> 00:12:23.540
NO. I'M NOT!

305
00:12:23.609 --> 00:12:25.442
HIM. YEAH. HE'S
A REAL LIGHTWEIGHT.

306
00:12:25.511 --> 00:12:27.945
MEG. TAKE
STEWIE UPSTAIRS.

307
00:12:28.014 --> 00:12:29.609
♪ SHOW ME THE WAY
TO GO HOME ♪

308
00:12:29.633 --> 00:12:30.732
EVERYBODY!

309
00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:32.277
♪ I'M TIRED AND I WANT
TO GO TO BED ♪

310
00:12:32.301 --> 00:12:33.418
JUST THE WOMEN!

311
00:12:33.486 --> 00:12:35.581
PETER. IN THE 17 YEARS
THAT WE'VE BEEN MARRIED

312
00:12:35.605 --> 00:12:38.005
I HAVE NEVER BEEN
AS ANGRY AS I...

313
00:12:38.742 --> 00:12:40.986
WHAT IS MY PIANO
DOING DOWN HERE?

314
00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:43.911
IT WAS SUPPOSED TO BE
A CLAM CAKE BUFFET. BUT...

315
00:12:43.979 --> 00:12:45.046
NEVER MIND.

316
00:12:45.114 --> 00:12:46.242
THAT DOES IT. PETER.

317
00:12:46.266 --> 00:12:48.277
EITHER THIS BAR
GOES OR I DO!

318
00:12:48.301 --> 00:12:50.051
LOIS. HONEY. I
HAVEN'T EVEN TOLD YOU

319
00:12:50.119 --> 00:12:51.886
THE OTHER REASON
YOUR PIANO'S DOWN HERE.

320
00:12:51.955 --> 00:12:54.989
I WANTED YOU TO PLAY IT.

321
00:12:55.058 --> 00:12:57.208
YOU KNOW. LIKE IT
WAS AN INSTRUMENT.

322
00:12:57.276 --> 00:12:59.196
I'M TELLING YOU THE
TRUTH. RIGHT. GUYS?

323
00:12:59.245 --> 00:13:00.327
[All agreeing]

324
00:13:00.397 --> 00:13:01.295
COME ON!

325
00:13:01.364 --> 00:13:02.947
OH. NO. I COULDN'T.

326
00:13:03.016 --> 00:13:04.048
COME ON!

327
00:13:04.116 --> 00:13:06.551
WELL. MAYBE ONE SONG.

328
00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:09.931
PRETEND YOU LIKE IT
NO MATTER HOW
BAD IT STINKS.

329
00:13:09.955 --> 00:13:11.005
[Giggles]

330
00:13:11.074 --> 00:13:13.424
♪ [Playing piano]

331
00:13:13.493 --> 00:13:16.760
♪ YOU'LL NEVER
KNOW JUST HOW MUCH ♪

332
00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:20.982
♪ I LOVE YOU ♪

333
00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:28.540
♪ YOU'LL NEVER KNOW
JUST HOW MUCH I CARE ♪

334
00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:32.776
[Man]
YEAH!

335
00:13:32.845 --> 00:13:35.763
♪ AND IF I TRY. I STILL ♪

336
00:13:35.832 --> 00:13:39.983
♪ COULDN'T HIDE
MY LOVE FOR YOU ♪

337
00:13:41.654 --> 00:13:43.054
♪ YOU OUGHTA KNOW ♪

338
00:13:43.122 --> 00:13:44.633
♪ FOR HAVEN'T I
TOLD YOU SO? ♪

339
00:13:44.657 --> 00:13:46.373
OK. GUYS. THANK YOU.

340
00:13:46.443 --> 00:13:47.869
YOU CAN STOP
PRETENDING NOW.

341
00:13:47.893 --> 00:13:49.087
[Man]
ALL RIGHT!

342
00:13:49.111 --> 00:13:52.063
♪ IF THERE IS SOME OTHER WAY ♪

343
00:13:52.132 --> 00:13:54.232
♪ TO PROVE THAT I LOVE YOU ♪

344
00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:56.651
♪ I SWEAR I DON'T KNOW HOW ♪

345
00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:58.381
SING IT. BABY.
BREAKING MY HEART.

346
00:13:58.405 --> 00:13:59.748
SOMETHING TROUBLING
YOU. PETER?

347
00:13:59.772 --> 00:14:03.090
NOTHING. JUST ALL MY FRIENDS
ARE EYE-HUMPING MY WIFE.

348
00:14:03.159 --> 00:14:07.962
♪ YOU'LL NEVER KNOW
IF YOU DON'T KNOW NOW ♪

349
00:14:09.933 --> 00:14:12.366
[All cheering]
WONDERFUL! WOW!

350
00:14:16.856 --> 00:14:18.672
IT WAS ABSOLUTELY
AMAZING.

351
00:14:18.758 --> 00:14:20.502
THE SECOND THAT
SPOTLIGHT HIT ME.

352
00:14:20.526 --> 00:14:22.204
I BECAME A WHOLE
DIFFERENT PERSON!

353
00:14:22.228 --> 00:14:24.040
SILENCE. YOU
CONTEMPTIBLE SHREW!

354
00:14:24.064 --> 00:14:26.497
OH. I BET YOUR GUMS
ARE STILL SORE.

355
00:14:26.566 --> 00:14:28.560
YOU'RE SO OBSERVANT.
AREN'T YOU?

356
00:14:28.584 --> 00:14:30.117
ARE YOU A DETECTIVE?

357
00:14:30.186 --> 00:14:31.964
YES. MY GUMS
ARE SORE!

358
00:14:31.988 --> 00:14:33.170
ENOUGH OF THIS!

359
00:14:33.239 --> 00:14:34.917
I MUST COMPLETE
MY TIME MACHINE.

360
00:14:34.941 --> 00:14:37.141
MOVE TIME FORWARD.
AND END THIS AGONY!

361
00:14:38.127 --> 00:14:39.193
HEY. DAD.

362
00:14:39.261 --> 00:14:41.729
MOM SAYS SHE WAS
REALLY ON LAST NIGHT.

363
00:14:41.798 --> 00:14:43.231
YEAH. ABOUT THAT.

364
00:14:43.299 --> 00:14:45.544
LOIS. SEE. THE GUYS
WERE JUST BEING POLITE.

365
00:14:45.568 --> 00:14:47.888
THEY THOUGHT YOUR
SINGING WAS TOO...

366
00:14:47.937 --> 00:14:50.638
I WAS JUST NERVOUS.
TONIGHT'LL BE BETTER.

367
00:14:50.707 --> 00:14:51.822
TONIGHT? HONEY.

368
00:14:51.891 --> 00:14:53.902
I DON'T THINK ANYONE'S
GONNA COME BACK TONIGHT.

369
00:14:53.926 --> 00:14:55.788
<i>♪ GIMME. GIMME.
GIMME. GIMME ♪</i>

370
00:14:55.812 --> 00:14:57.395
<i>♪ WHAT I CRY FOR ♪</i>

371
00:14:57.464 --> 00:14:59.658
<i>♪ YOU KNOW YOU GOT
THE BRAND OF KISSES ♪</i>

372
00:14:59.682 --> 00:15:01.299
<i>♪ THAT I DIE FOR ♪</i>

373
00:15:01.367 --> 00:15:03.317
OH. THIS ONE TAKES ME BACK.

374
00:15:03.386 --> 00:15:04.835
NOW THAT'S A WOMAN!

375
00:15:04.904 --> 00:15:06.170
THAT'S A HOUSE.

376
00:15:06.239 --> 00:15:08.205
THAT'S A FISH.
THAT'S A BEE!

377
00:15:08.274 --> 00:15:12.093
<i>♪ YOU KNOW YOU
MADE ME LOVE YOU ♪</i>

378
00:15:13.696 --> 00:15:15.529
<i>I LOVE YOU.</i>

379
00:15:15.598 --> 00:15:17.865
THANK YOU. THANK YOU.

380
00:15:17.934 --> 00:15:20.234
<i>JOHNNY MULDOON.
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN.</i>

381
00:15:20.302 --> 00:15:21.869
[Crowd applauding]

382
00:15:21.937 --> 00:15:25.172
<i>I WAS BORN IN A
LITTLE TOWN CALLED QUAHOG.</i>

383
00:15:25.241 --> 00:15:27.353
[Man]
WE LOVE YOU.
LOIS! WHOO!

384
00:15:27.377 --> 00:15:28.743
[Laughing]

385
00:15:28.812 --> 00:15:30.895
<i>LET ME FINISH
THE STORY. FELLAS.</i>

386
00:15:30.964 --> 00:15:33.147
<i>YOU DON'T WANT TO
BE UP ALL NIGHT.</i>

387
00:15:33.216 --> 00:15:34.582
<i>OR DO YOU?</i>

388
00:15:34.651 --> 00:15:35.817
"OR DO YOU?"

389
00:15:35.885 --> 00:15:38.113
SHE'S A SMOKIN' LITTLE
PISTOL. ISN'T SHE?

390
00:15:38.137 --> 00:15:39.069
ARE YOU A WOMAN?

391
00:15:39.138 --> 00:15:40.258
NO.

392
00:15:42.441 --> 00:15:45.171
MY HOUSE ARREST
IS OVER. BRIAN.
ROUND UP THE GUYS.

393
00:15:45.195 --> 00:15:48.207
NOW THAT I'M A FREE
MAN. WE CAN DO
ANYTHING WE WANT.

394
00:15:48.231 --> 00:15:49.859
THE GUYS ONLY
WANT TO DO ONE THING.

395
00:15:49.883 --> 00:15:51.932
AND THAT'S OGLE
YOUR WIFE.

396
00:15:52.001 --> 00:15:54.302
IF LOIS WERE MY WOMAN.
I'D KEEP AN EYE ON HER.

397
00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:55.969
THEN AGAIN. I'M
THE JEALOUS TYPE.

398
00:15:59.676 --> 00:16:03.022
WOW! LOIS GRIFFIN!
I LOVE YOUR ACT.
NICE MELONS.

399
00:16:03.046 --> 00:16:04.112
LISTEN. PAL...

400
00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:05.980
PETER. I'M HOLDING
MELONS.

401
00:16:06.032 --> 00:16:06.981
OH.

402
00:16:07.049 --> 00:16:07.982
AND HER HOOTERS
AIN'T BAD EITHER!

403
00:16:08.051 --> 00:16:09.600
NOW HANG ON
A SECOND THERE!

404
00:16:09.669 --> 00:16:11.752
PETER. I'M HOLDING
HOOTERS.

405
00:16:11.821 --> 00:16:12.770
SORRY.

406
00:16:12.839 --> 00:16:14.271
NO PROBLEM.

407
00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:15.518
YOUR WIFE'S
HOT!

408
00:16:15.542 --> 00:16:17.486
THAT'S IT! LOIS. YOUR
SINGING DAYS ARE OVER.

409
00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:20.256
FOR GOD'S SAKE. IF I
WANTED TO MARRY LOLA FALANA.
I WOULD HAVE.

410
00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:22.041
LOOK. LOLA. THIS
WHOLE THING
IS JUST GOING

411
00:16:22.065 --> 00:16:23.564
WAY TOO FAST
FOR ME.

412
00:16:23.633 --> 00:16:25.477
[Sobbing]
FOR THE LAST TIME.
I'M NOT LOLA!

413
00:16:25.501 --> 00:16:26.901
I'M LESLIE UGGAMS!

414
00:16:26.969 --> 00:16:30.071
PETER. HAVING ME
SING WAS YOUR IDEA
IN THE FIRST PLACE.

415
00:16:30.139 --> 00:16:32.201
HEY. I JUST WANTED
TO KEEP MY BAR.

416
00:16:32.225 --> 00:16:33.786
I BUILT THAT
THING SO MY FRIENDS

417
00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:35.638
WOULD COME TO
SEE ME. NOT YOU.

418
00:16:35.662 --> 00:16:38.295
IS THAT SO? LET ME
TELL YOU SOMETHING.

419
00:16:38.364 --> 00:16:39.430
I LOVE SINGING!

420
00:16:39.499 --> 00:16:41.579
AND I WILL CONTINUE
TO SING! AND...

421
00:16:41.634 --> 00:16:44.736
HOW DARE YOU UPSET ME
THIS CLOSE TO SHOWTIME!

422
00:16:44.804 --> 00:16:46.137
LOIS.

423
00:16:46.205 --> 00:16:48.017
HEY. WATCH WHERE
YOU'RE GOING. BUDDY.

424
00:16:48.041 --> 00:16:50.875
GRIFFIN. I GOT A BONE
TO PICK WITH YOU.

425
00:16:50.944 --> 00:16:52.737
WHOAH. LISTEN. I DON'T WANT
ANY MORE TROUBLE.

426
00:16:52.761 --> 00:16:53.844
THANKS TO YOUR WIFE

427
00:16:53.913 --> 00:16:55.846
MY HUSBAND HASN'T
BEEN HOME ALL WEEK!

428
00:16:55.915 --> 00:16:58.282
THAT SINGING
HUSSY IS DESTROYING
OUR MARRIAGES!

429
00:16:59.085 --> 00:17:00.211
MM-HMM.

430
00:17:00.235 --> 00:17:01.713
YEAH. THEN DO SOMETHING
ABOUT IT.

431
00:17:01.737 --> 00:17:03.098
COME TO MY
BASEMENT TONIGHT

432
00:17:03.122 --> 00:17:04.750
AND DRAG YOUR HUSBANDS
OUT OF THERE YOURSELVES.

433
00:17:04.774 --> 00:17:06.056
MAYBE
WE WILL.

434
00:17:06.125 --> 00:17:07.374
YEAH!

435
00:17:07.443 --> 00:17:10.361
JEEZ. FELLA. CAN'T
YOU TAKE THAT OUTSIDE?

436
00:17:14.083 --> 00:17:16.028
<i>THIS NEXT NUMBER
IS DEDICATED</i>

437
00:17:16.052 --> 00:17:18.836
TO MY VERY SUPPORTIVE
HUSBAND. PETER.

438
00:17:18.905 --> 00:17:19.905
HUH?

439
00:17:20.106 --> 00:17:21.305
HIT IT!

440
00:17:21.374 --> 00:17:24.041
<i>♪ DON'T TELL ME NOT TO FLY
I'VE SIMPLY GOTTA ♪</i>

441
00:17:24.110 --> 00:17:27.294
<i>♪ IF SOMEONE TAKES A SPILL
IT'S ME AND NOT YOU ♪</i>

442
00:17:27.363 --> 00:17:32.599
<i>♪ DON'T BRING AROUND A CLOUD
TO RAIN ON MY PARADE ♪</i>

443
00:17:32.668 --> 00:17:34.680
OH. BOY. LOIS IS
PRETTY PISSED. HUH?

444
00:17:34.704 --> 00:17:37.354
YES. YOUR JUDGMENT LATELY
HAS BEEN RATHER...

445
00:17:37.424 --> 00:17:39.573
YOU HAVE CRAPPY
JUDGMENT ANYWAY.

446
00:17:39.642 --> 00:17:41.258
OH. THIS IS INTOLERABLE!

447
00:17:41.327 --> 00:17:44.223
THIS FOOLISHNESS
IS PREVENTING ME
FROM COMPLETING WORK ON...

448
00:17:44.247 --> 00:17:46.831
EGADS! THE BLUEPRINTS
FOR MY TIME MACHINE!

449
00:17:46.899 --> 00:17:48.360
THOSE ARE FOR
MY EYES ONLY!

450
00:17:48.384 --> 00:17:50.267
<i>THANK YOU.</i>

451
00:17:50.336 --> 00:17:54.004
<i>LOOK EVERYONE.</i>
<i>STEWIE DREW A</i>
<i>PICTURE FOR HIS MOMMY.</i>

452
00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:55.622
NO!

453
00:17:59.028 --> 00:18:00.828
HOLD UP THE PICTURE.
LET'S SEE.

454
00:18:00.897 --> 00:18:02.647
NO! NOTHING TO SEE HERE.

455
00:18:02.715 --> 00:18:05.399
[Cleveland]
HOW CUTE.
IT'S A TIME MACHINE!

456
00:18:05.468 --> 00:18:06.818
NO! IT'S A...

457
00:18:06.886 --> 00:18:08.536
BLAST. WHAT THE DEVIL
DO CHILDREN DRAW?

458
00:18:08.604 --> 00:18:10.037
IT'S A PHEASANT!

459
00:18:10.106 --> 00:18:12.651
A TIME MACHINE. SURE.
HERE'S WHERE THE
FLUX CAPACITOR GOES.

460
00:18:12.675 --> 00:18:14.709
I CAN'T WAIT
TO BUILD ONE OF
THESE OF MY OWN.

461
00:18:14.777 --> 00:18:17.445
I'LL NOT STAND IDLY BY
WHILE YOU ABROGATE MY PLANS.

462
00:18:17.513 --> 00:18:19.564
YOU SHALL RUE THIS DAY.

463
00:18:19.632 --> 00:18:22.066
GO ON! START RUING!

464
00:18:22.134 --> 00:18:25.586
BYE-BYE. STEWIE.
MOMMY WILL BE UPSTAIRS
TO KISS YOU GOOD NIGHT.

465
00:18:25.655 --> 00:18:27.220
BURN IN HELL!

466
00:18:27.289 --> 00:18:29.556
<i>HELL. HELL HAS FIRE.</i>

467
00:18:29.642 --> 00:18:31.609
<i>AND YOU KNOW WHAT ELSE?</i>

468
00:18:31.678 --> 00:18:35.129
<i>♪ IT'S GOT STEAM HEAT ♪</i>

469
00:18:35.197 --> 00:18:36.463
<i>♪ I GOT ♪</i>

470
00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:38.933
<i>♪ STEAM HEAT ♪</i>

471
00:18:39.002 --> 00:18:40.333
<i>♪ I GOT ♪</i>

472
00:18:41.037 --> 00:18:42.836
<i>♪ STEAM HEAT ♪</i>

473
00:18:42.905 --> 00:18:45.022
<i>♪ BUT I NEED YOUR LOVE ♪</i>

474
00:18:45.074 --> 00:18:47.108
<i>♪ TO KEEP AWAY
THE COLD I GOT... ♪</i>

475
00:18:47.193 --> 00:18:49.259
ALL RIGHT.
BREAK IT UP!

476
00:18:49.328 --> 00:18:50.655
WHAT'S GOING
ON HERE?

477
00:18:50.679 --> 00:18:52.213
YOUR LITTLE
PEEP SHOW IS OVER!

478
00:18:52.281 --> 00:18:53.964
WE'RE TAKING BACK
OUR MEN!

479
00:18:54.033 --> 00:18:57.067
PEEP SHOW? I JUST
DO THIS FOR FUN.

480
00:18:57.136 --> 00:18:59.414
LOOK. ALL DAY LONG
I SCRUB AND COOK

481
00:18:59.438 --> 00:19:02.089
AND TAKE CARE OF MY KIDS.
AND NOBODY CHEERS.

482
00:19:02.158 --> 00:19:03.953
NO ONE EVEN
SAYS THANK YOU.

483
00:19:03.977 --> 00:19:05.742
BUT WHEN THE BAND
STARTS PLAYING AND

484
00:19:05.811 --> 00:19:07.523
THE MUSIC'S FLOWING
THROUGH ME.

485
00:19:07.547 --> 00:19:10.030
I FEEL. I DON'T KNOW.
SPECIAL.

486
00:19:11.433 --> 00:19:14.118
I GUESS YOU ALL THINK
THAT'S PRETTY SILLY.

487
00:19:14.186 --> 00:19:15.069
NOT AT ALL.

488
00:19:15.138 --> 00:19:16.532
YOU DIDN'T TELL US
THAT PART!

489
00:19:16.556 --> 00:19:17.556
UH-UH.

490
00:19:18.907 --> 00:19:21.458
PETER. YOU'RE
BEHIND ALL THIS?

491
00:19:21.527 --> 00:19:23.627
YES. AND YOU'LL
NEVER CATCH ME!

492
00:19:23.696 --> 00:19:24.929
[Cackling]

493
00:19:24.981 --> 00:19:25.996
AAH!

494
00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:28.626
I BET HE ALSO
DIDN'T TELL YOU

495
00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:30.478
HE NEVER HELPS ME
AROUND THE HOUSE.

496
00:19:30.502 --> 00:19:32.164
OR TAKES ME OUT
TO DINNER.

497
00:19:32.188 --> 00:19:33.832
OR NOTICES WHEN
I GET MY HAIR DONE.

498
00:19:33.856 --> 00:19:35.339
OH. NO.
THAT'S JUST...

499
00:19:35.407 --> 00:19:37.367
MY HUSBAND'S
THE SAME WAY.

500
00:19:37.409 --> 00:19:38.742
SO'S MINE.

501
00:19:38.811 --> 00:19:40.044
[Women chattering]

502
00:19:40.113 --> 00:19:43.197
WOW. THIS PLACE IS FULL
OF DEAD PIGEONS.

503
00:19:43.266 --> 00:19:44.826
I'M GONNA GO GRAB
SOME OZONE.

504
00:19:46.302 --> 00:19:47.334
HEY!

505
00:19:47.403 --> 00:19:49.353
PETER! THERE'S A
KING IN THE CARDS!

506
00:19:49.422 --> 00:19:50.704
THEY SAW MY BLUEPRINTS!

507
00:19:50.773 --> 00:19:53.490
WHAT A GRIEVOUS BREACH
OF SECURITY!

508
00:19:53.559 --> 00:19:55.292
DAMN! WHAT DO TO?

509
00:19:55.361 --> 00:19:57.561
WAIT FOR IT...
WAIT FOR IT...

510
00:19:58.364 --> 00:19:59.296
YES!

511
00:19:59.364 --> 00:20:01.026
INSTEAD OF MOVING
TIME FORWARD

512
00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:02.928
TO BYPASS THIS
WRETCHED TEETHING.

513
00:20:02.952 --> 00:20:04.534
IT MIGHT JUST BE POSSIBLE

514
00:20:04.603 --> 00:20:06.237
TO REVERSE TIME'S HEADY FLOW

515
00:20:06.305 --> 00:20:08.989
AND UNDO EVER HAVING DRAWN
THOSE DAMNABLE BLUEPRINTS.

516
00:20:09.058 --> 00:20:10.468
YOU'LL NEVER GET
AWAY WITH THIS!

517
00:20:10.492 --> 00:20:11.942
SILENCE!
OH.

518
00:20:12.011 --> 00:20:14.545
LOIS. YOU MAKE IT
SOUND LIKE I DON'T
APPRECIATE YOU AT ALL.

519
00:20:14.613 --> 00:20:16.197
PETER. WHEN WAS THE LAST TIME

520
00:20:16.265 --> 00:20:17.865
YOU TOLD ME YOU LOVE ME?

521
00:20:17.933 --> 00:20:19.282
YOU KNOW I DO.

522
00:20:19.351 --> 00:20:20.868
I WANT TO HEAR IT!

523
00:20:20.937 --> 00:20:22.397
IS THAT WHAT
THIS IS ALL ABOUT?

524
00:20:22.421 --> 00:20:24.154
RUN FOR YOUR LIVES!

525
00:20:25.091 --> 00:20:26.423
HOLY CRAP!

526
00:20:27.042 --> 00:20:28.125
HOT!

527
00:20:30.413 --> 00:20:31.523
[Both]
AAH!

528
00:20:31.547 --> 00:20:32.775
THERE'S NO
WAY OUT!

529
00:20:32.799 --> 00:20:34.959
AT LAST! MY TIME
DEVICE IS COMPLETE!

530
00:20:35.001 --> 00:20:38.052
JUST ONE FINAL
ADJUSTMENT. THERE.

531
00:20:38.121 --> 00:20:39.236
NOW I SHALL NEGATE

532
00:20:39.305 --> 00:20:42.023
EVER HAVING DRAWN
THOSE DAMNABLE BLUEPRINTS.

533
00:20:42.091 --> 00:20:43.273
BLAST!

534
00:20:43.342 --> 00:20:44.859
JEEZ. WE'RE SCREWED!

535
00:20:44.927 --> 00:20:47.094
LOOK. I PROMISE IF WE
GET OUT OF THIS ALIVE

536
00:20:47.163 --> 00:20:48.895
I'M GONNA HELP
OUT AROUND THE HOUSE

537
00:20:48.964 --> 00:20:50.630
AND SAY "I LOVE
YOU" EVERY DAY.

538
00:20:50.699 --> 00:20:51.615
YOU MEAN IT?

539
00:20:51.684 --> 00:20:54.134
I'M A CHANGED MAN.
LOIS. A BETTER MAN.

540
00:20:54.203 --> 00:20:57.187
AND TO THINK.
IF I HADN'T TAKEN
CHRIS TO HIS SOCCER GAME

541
00:20:57.239 --> 00:20:59.723
I NEVER WOULD'VE LEARNED
THIS VALUABLE LESSON.

542
00:21:07.366 --> 00:21:09.083
[Speaking in rewind]

543
00:21:09.151 --> 00:21:10.451
HONEY. I'M BEGGING YOU.

544
00:21:10.519 --> 00:21:12.364
DROP CHRIS OFF AT
HIS SOCCER GAME

545
00:21:12.388 --> 00:21:13.498
AND COME RIGHT HOME.

546
00:21:13.522 --> 00:21:15.066
I NEED YOU TO
LOOK AFTER STEWIE

547
00:21:15.090 --> 00:21:17.119
WHILE I'M TEACHING
PIANO LESSONS. PLEASE!

548
00:21:17.143 --> 00:21:18.976
ALL RIGHT! ALL RIGHT!

549
00:21:19.045 --> 00:21:20.594
HEH. YOU KNOW I SPOIL YOU.

550
00:21:22.131 --> 00:21:24.398
OH. MY FOOT!
I CAN'T WALK!

551
00:21:24.467 --> 00:21:26.467
I GUESS YOU'LL HAVE
TO TAKE CHRIS YOURSELF.

552
00:21:26.535 --> 00:21:27.568
[Laughing]

553
00:21:27.636 --> 00:21:30.821
AHH! MY DEVICE!
MY TEETH!

554
00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:32.840
I'M FREE! FREE!

555
00:21:32.909 --> 00:21:36.076
I CLAIM THIS MOUTH IN
THE NAME OF INCISOR!

556
00:21:36.145 --> 00:21:37.445
I THINK NOT!

557
00:21:37.513 --> 00:21:38.312
[Gasps]

558
00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:40.592
BICUSPID!
WE MEET AGAIN.

559
00:21:40.616 --> 00:21:42.516
HAVE AT YOU!
EN GARDE!

560
00:21:42.585 --> 00:21:43.818
[Groaning]

561
00:21:45.955 --> 00:21:47.195
SHALL WE BITE
THE TONGUE THEN?

562
00:21:47.256 --> 00:21:49.723
ON 3.1. 2...

563
00:21:49.792 --> 00:21:50.808
AAH!

564
00:21:52.962 --> 00:21:55.162
♪ [Theme music playing]
